            "review_title": "Review at Vietnam Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Charlesquil\nDublin, California305 contributions\n0\nBest Local food in Nha Trang\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nBeen to this Vietnamese restaurant so many times in the last 20 years and I’m confident to say that this is the best local Vietnamese cuisine by far in Nha Trang.\nI love the service here as many of them are relatives of restaurant owner. There are always smiles on their face.\nStrongly recommend: steamed fish roll (Goi Ca Mai), steamed squid with sweet and sour spicy sauce, deep fried tuna fillet served in fish sauce and young mango.\nRead more\nWritten February 19, 2019",
