            "review_title": "Review at Vietnam Restaurant",
            "review_text": "billcoo\nSan Angelo, Texas253 contributions\n0\nExcellent Vietnamese food\nMar 2018 • Family\nStill like going to this restaurant, mostly locals or Vietnamese that eat here. Not sure about the bad reviews, but some restaurants in Vietnam can be hit or miss, depending on what day or time you go. The Heo Kho is excellent here. As mentioned in a previous review I did notice cheaper beer prices, less than $1 usd for a bottle of beer. Tip, ask for the English menu.\nRead more\nWritten March 25, 2018",
