            "review_title": "Review at Vietnam Restaurant",
            "review_text": "David R\nGold Coast, Australia220 contributions\n0\nIt's a winner.\nMar 2015 • Friends\nI first went to the Vietnam in 1994. It was in a different location and not quite as up market as today. At one stage there were two of them. The last time I ate there the original owner was still operating it and very well at that. It's not far from the market so even if you're feeling peckish, grab a bite there. It's always chock a block with locals, so that' the best sign that there is. One thing that you must try there is the Tom Hoa Tien (Rocket Shrimp) . It's the best that I have tried anywhere in the world.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 14, 2015",
