            "review_title": "Review at Vietnam Restaurant",
            "review_text": "ntguy\nBrossard, Canada720 contributions\n0\nA simple inexpensive but authentic good vietnamese family food\nDec 2014 • Friends\nSimple but tasty authentic vietnamese cuisine dishes are served here. A family dinner consists of a fried fish with mango shreddings, a sweet and sour soup, a chicken or beef or pork sauteed with some vegetable, and some rice. Many side dishes of vegetable can be ordered. If an entree is desired, the lemon beef is a good choice amongst others. A complete good supper for four with four different dishes cost around 10-15us$.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 5, 2014",
